{
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "武商集团的商场和超市，开始支持支付宝“碰一下”付款",
  "title_en": "Wushang Group's malls and supermarkets start to support Alipay “Tap” payment",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月28日，武商集团和支付宝宣布合作。以后，武商集团的商场和超市都可以用支付宝的“碰一下”付款。",
      "en": "On October 28, Wushang Group and Alipay announced a partnership. From now on, Wushang Group's malls and supermarkets can all accept Alipay's “Tap” payment."
    },
    {
      "zh": "“碰一下”是一种不用打开软件、也不用出示付款码的付款方式。顾客先解锁手机，再用手机碰一下收款设备，就可以付款了。",
      "en": "“Tap” is a way to pay without opening an app or showing a payment code. The customer first unlocks the phone, then taps it on the payment device, and the payment is done."
    },
    {
      "zh": "付款的时候，顾客还可以顺便加入武商集团的会员，并领取礼品、停车券和优惠券。双方还会一起办活动，发放专属优惠券。",
      "en": "While paying, customers can also join Wushang Group's membership and claim gifts, parking vouchers and coupons. The two sides will also hold events together and give out exclusive coupons."
    },
    {
      "zh": "武商集团还会用支付宝的技术，做一个叫“豚宝”的人工智能购物助手。它可以回答打折、服务台、停车位和洗手间位置等问题。另外，武商集团也会和蚂蚁森林一起做公益活动。",
      "en": "Wushang Group will also use Alipay's technology to build an AI shopping assistant called “Tunbao”. It can answer questions about discounts, the service desk, parking spaces and where the restrooms are. In addition, Wushang Group will do public-welfare activities together with Ant Forest."
    }
  ],
