      "pos": "noun",
      "en": "payment code",
      "note": "The QR/bar code a customer shows to pay: 出示付款码 (show the payment code), 扫付款码 (scan the payment code), 用付款码付款 (pay with a payment code).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "顾客打开手机，给收银员看付款码。",
          "py": "Gùkè dǎkāi shǒujī, gěi shōuyínyuán kàn fùkuǎnmǎ.",
          "en": "The customer opens the phone and shows the cashier the payment code."
        },
        {
          "zh": "我们的平台上，用付款码付款的比例每个月都不一样。",
          "py": "Wǒmen de píngtái shàng, yòng fùkuǎnmǎ fùkuǎn de bǐlì měi gè yuè dōu bù yíyàng.",
          "en": "On our platform, the share of payments made with payment codes is different every month."
        },
        {
          "zh": "我的手机没电了，所以不能用付款码。",
          "py": "Wǒ de shǒujī méi diàn le, suǒyǐ bù néng yòng fùkuǎnmǎ.",
          "en": "My phone is out of battery, so I can't use a payment code."
        }
      ]
    },
